   "kind": "text",
   "text": "You have financial statement analysis, Excel, accounting and PowerPoint, plus a credit internship and an investment fund role behind them. In the internship you analyzed company financials in Excel, and at the fund you researched stocks and pitched them to a committee. A summer analyst does both every day, so you would walk in already knowing the work. It hires for graduation between December 2027 and June 2028, and you graduate in May 2028, so this is the summer that leads to an offer.",
